  008200              :PANEL NAME=ABOUT KEYL=SELKEYS TOPSEP=SPACE.About Widgets
  008300              :INFO DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
  008400              :H1.What a widget is
  008500              :P.A widget is an object of the library it lives in. Its text, kind,
  008600              owner and quantity are shown by the display panel and changed by the
  008700              change panel.
  008800              :P.Press :PK.F12:EPK. to go back to the menu.
  008900              :EINFO.
